WEBVTT

00:11.018 --> 00:13.895
KIRINOSHIMA JUNIOR HIGH SCHOOL

00:13.979 --> 00:16.565
That club sucked the life out of me.
I couldn't wait to finally be

00:16.648 --> 00:17.941
done with it.

00:18.025 --> 00:20.902
Uh, can we talk about Miki for a sec?
Like, she was always way too into it,

00:20.986 --> 00:22.029
wasn't she?

00:22.112 --> 00:25.323
- Totally.
- I never said anything, but she was a lot.

00:25.407 --> 00:26.533
I know, right?

00:26.616 --> 00:27.743
It's like "calm down."

00:28.410 --> 00:29.870
I had to get out of there…

00:29.953 --> 00:31.955
Become someone new, somewhere else.

00:33.665 --> 00:37.586
So I started going to a cram school in a
different city so I could escape, and

00:37.669 --> 00:41.548
INCREASE YOUR CHANCES FOR PASSING!
ACCEPTING STUDENTS FOR THE NEW SCHOOL YEAR

00:43.592 --> 00:45.552
I knew the transition wouldn't be easy…

00:46.219 --> 00:48.388
But I haven't made a single friend yet.

00:48.472 --> 00:50.974
They've already formed their own little
cliques.

00:51.767 --> 00:53.101
Should I talk to them?

00:53.185 --> 00:55.562
- No, that's way too scary.
- GROUP GIRLS

00:55.645 --> 00:58.565
I mean, let's say I become friends with
them. Seems like girls pretend to be

00:58.648 --> 01:01.109
friendly to your face, then turn
around and talk about you behind

01:01.193 --> 01:02.444
your back.

01:03.737 --> 01:05.864
- Ugh! Even the thought of it is
- UGH…

01:05.947 --> 01:08.200
traumatizing me all over again.

01:16.166 --> 01:17.292
I'm so alone.

01:19.669 --> 01:20.504
Hi, there.

01:21.046 --> 01:22.881
Can I… sit with you?

01:28.220 --> 01:29.054
Who're you?

01:29.137 --> 01:32.349
Huh? Oh! My name is Minato Amamiya.

02:58.351 --> 03:00.687
THE RAMPARTS OF ICE

03:09.070 --> 03:11.948
MEITEN HIGH SCHOOL

03:12.032 --> 03:15.619
Ughh! This exam is covering way too much
material!

03:15.702 --> 03:17.704
Well, why didn't you start studying
earlier?

03:17.787 --> 03:18.788
So Minato…

03:19.289 --> 03:20.790
Why'd you leave and come back?

03:20.874 --> 03:22.125
I forgot my notebook.

03:22.667 --> 03:23.919
And I needed it to study.

03:24.544 --> 03:25.795
I don't get any of it!

03:25.879 --> 03:26.838
Oh, come on.

03:27.797 --> 03:29.466
The four of us studying together.

03:30.717 --> 03:34.095
This all feels… So foreign to me.

03:35.472 --> 03:37.098
Oh. Have you heard, Miki?

03:37.182 --> 03:39.017
- Mm?
- Yeah, I got dumped again.

03:39.100 --> 03:40.810
I'm sorry, what?! When was this?

03:40.894 --> 03:43.271
- Two days ago.
- Wait, this just happened?

03:43.772 --> 03:45.357
Why? What'd you do wrong?

03:45.440 --> 03:47.234
Why do you assume it's my fault?

03:47.734 --> 03:50.779
- Wow, okay I see how it is. Automatically
- Oh, please, it's pretty much always

03:50.862 --> 03:52.405
- your fault. Did you say something dumb
- assume Minato's the jerk. Thanks guys.

03:52.489 --> 03:56.368
- Your fault. Did you say something dumb
- Assume Minato's the jerk. Thanks guys.

03:56.451 --> 03:58.578
Man… I'm never the one doing the dumping.

03:59.079 --> 04:00.664
That's what bothers you?

04:02.499 --> 04:03.625
- What? Surprised?
- No.

04:03.708 --> 04:04.542
No I'm…

04:06.503 --> 04:07.754
How do I put this?

04:11.216 --> 04:13.343
I thought when someone got dumped they'd
be…

04:13.426 --> 04:14.511
Well, a bit more…

04:16.680 --> 04:22.602
I dunno, maybe depressed or bitter, like,
holding a grudge or something?

04:24.437 --> 04:25.272
But why?

04:27.107 --> 04:32.112
For me, I just appreciate someone was
into me, even for a short time.

04:32.195 --> 04:33.321
You know what I mean?

04:33.405 --> 04:35.198
- Like "Thank you!"
- Yeah, right.

04:35.282 --> 04:36.533
- Hah!
- Hm?

04:38.159 --> 04:40.996
How can someone be so casual about a
breakup?

04:41.871 --> 04:43.873
Oh. Was I too casual about it?

04:43.957 --> 04:44.791
Agh!

04:45.750 --> 04:48.295
I don't show it, but I'm definitely
still hurt by it.

04:48.378 --> 04:49.379
So…

04:50.463 --> 04:51.298
Oh no…

04:51.965 --> 04:54.301
I should've been more sensitive about it.

04:55.051 --> 04:55.885
DOWN

04:55.969 --> 04:58.054
I-I, um… I'm sorry.

05:00.223 --> 05:01.266
I forgive ya.

05:02.058 --> 05:03.560
Can I cry on your shoulder?

05:06.104 --> 05:06.938
Uh.

05:09.482 --> 05:11.651
Yeah, no, that'll be enough of
that, thanks!

05:11.735 --> 05:14.112
Oh, Minato, you're such a kidder, you.

05:14.195 --> 05:15.613
You're crushing… my face.

05:16.114 --> 05:17.073
Koyun…

05:17.157 --> 05:20.410
Minato's always messing around,
so you can just ignore him.

05:20.493 --> 05:21.536
Oh.

05:21.619 --> 05:22.662
What does that mean?

05:22.746 --> 05:23.747
Mm.

05:25.081 --> 05:26.791
Hm? Miki?

05:27.876 --> 05:30.337
- Hey, Yota-sensei, I don't get this part.
- Mm?

05:30.420 --> 05:31.379
Hm?

05:31.463 --> 05:32.339
Ah!

05:32.422 --> 05:33.256
Oh, my gosh!

05:33.340 --> 05:35.342
Ah, ha, oh no, I did it again! Oh man.
I'm so sorry!

05:35.425 --> 05:37.469
Jeez! Are you kidding me? There you
go again with your clumsy self.

05:37.552 --> 05:38.386
I- I'm clumsy?

05:38.928 --> 05:41.473
Yeah! You're always dropping things.
That's literally the definition

05:41.556 --> 05:43.224
- Yeah, yeah.
- of clumsy.

05:43.308 --> 05:44.476
Let me… Well… Oh, crap.

05:45.643 --> 05:47.729
FLUSTER
JEEZ!

05:48.229 --> 05:50.106
Here. Is that everything?

05:50.190 --> 05:51.358
Whew, thanks.

05:57.030 --> 05:59.574
She laughs, so she's human after all.

06:02.577 --> 06:03.411
Oh.

06:05.663 --> 06:06.498
Okay.

06:06.581 --> 06:08.291
Me and Koyun are going this way.

06:08.375 --> 06:09.626
Should I walk you there?

06:09.709 --> 06:12.128
No, you don't have to, but thanks
for offering.

06:12.212 --> 06:15.131
Yeah, I dare someone to mess with us
while I'm here. I've got killer grip

06:15.215 --> 06:16.049
strength!

06:16.132 --> 06:17.634
Yeah, she's not messing around.

06:17.717 --> 06:19.427
You be careful too, Miki.

06:21.930 --> 06:24.432
See ya, Yota! Thanks so much for
your help today!

06:24.516 --> 06:25.683
Hey, what about me?

06:25.767 --> 06:27.310
I helped you with English.

06:27.394 --> 06:28.478
Oh yeah, you too.

06:28.561 --> 06:29.521
Gee, thanks a lot.

06:30.021 --> 06:33.983
Koyun, I'm dying to eat at Da Pote
across from the station. Can we stop by?

06:34.067 --> 06:36.069
Sure, but what happened to dinner at
home?

06:36.152 --> 06:38.738
Don't worry, I'll have room. This is an
appetizer.

06:39.656 --> 06:40.490
Ridiculous.

06:40.573 --> 06:42.617
It's true! I've got a separate
stomach for it!

06:42.700 --> 06:44.411
Miki sure does talk a lot, huh?

06:44.911 --> 06:46.788
She should be like that all the time.

06:47.914 --> 06:49.332
So, what're you doin' now?

06:49.416 --> 06:50.333
Hm?

06:50.417 --> 06:51.626
WIENER DOG EXTRA FILLING

06:51.709 --> 06:55.171
I'm having one of these bad boys!
On the way to the community center.

06:55.255 --> 06:56.089
Are you serious?

06:56.172 --> 06:58.550
You're gonna give yourself food
poisoning, man!

06:59.342 --> 07:00.802
Wanna have dinner at my place?

07:00.885 --> 07:02.887
Mom loves it whenever you come over.

07:02.971 --> 07:03.888
Mmmm.

07:03.972 --> 07:05.682
Nah, I gotta go study some more.

07:06.182 --> 07:07.851
- See ya.
- Okay.

07:09.686 --> 07:11.396
You're making me look bad, ya know.

07:11.479 --> 07:12.814
Nah, that's impossible.

07:14.607 --> 07:16.151
In more ways than one.

07:18.153 --> 07:18.987
Hm.

07:21.698 --> 07:23.074
Yota was acting like that, but…

07:23.158 --> 07:24.576
WASH YOUR HANDS AND GARGLE

07:24.659 --> 07:25.577
What about her?

07:27.078 --> 07:28.496
I wonder how she feels.

07:31.207 --> 07:34.961
Could it be that maybe she's into him?

07:36.421 --> 07:37.255
Hmmm.

07:39.591 --> 07:42.051
I don't think Yota would be a good fit
for her.

07:48.516 --> 07:50.018
- Hey, wait for me!
- So, Koyun…

07:54.314 --> 07:56.024
Huh? I only met him recently.

07:56.524 --> 07:59.402
Like, literally the day before we walked
home together.

08:01.029 --> 08:03.656
He just came up to talk to me randomly in
the stairwell.

08:03.740 --> 08:05.742
- What'd he say?
- Hm?

08:08.620 --> 08:09.454
Uh.

08:10.997 --> 08:11.831
Uh…

08:13.666 --> 08:15.001
Wait… What did he say?

08:15.502 --> 08:16.503
Argh!

08:17.295 --> 08:20.381
We didn't really talk about anything
important, to be honest.

08:21.257 --> 08:22.634
Sorry to disappoint.

08:22.717 --> 08:23.843
Oh, Koyun…

08:23.927 --> 08:25.762
That's so like you.

08:28.473 --> 08:29.599
Well, alright.

08:29.682 --> 08:31.059
I guess it's fine, then.

08:31.142 --> 08:31.976
No worries.

08:33.603 --> 08:34.854
Wait, does Miki…

08:44.948 --> 08:46.199
Could she possibly…

08:54.499 --> 08:56.292
I wish I hadn't overslept.

08:58.294 --> 09:02.006
I prefer walking to school before
everyone else, to avoid the crowds.

09:03.883 --> 09:06.553
Yeah, I should've left, like, thirty
minutes earlier.

09:09.639 --> 09:11.266
During exams…

09:11.975 --> 09:16.312
In the mornings, the usually packed
streets are so quiet.

09:25.738 --> 09:27.782
I prefer it, for some reason.

09:30.952 --> 09:33.079
You normally come to school round
this time?

09:33.162 --> 09:34.163
Huh?

09:34.247 --> 09:35.081
Morning.

09:35.873 --> 09:39.043
When I saw you, I was worried I came to
school too early today.

09:39.127 --> 09:40.211
Miss Earlybird.

09:40.753 --> 09:41.588
Well…

09:42.255 --> 09:43.089
Uh, I…

09:44.090 --> 09:46.926
I normally come much later during
non-exam times.

09:47.010 --> 09:50.138
Today, I was originally hoping to
come even earlier, but then…

09:50.930 --> 09:52.390
That's too much explanation.

09:53.766 --> 09:54.809
No, I usually…

09:55.602 --> 09:56.436
Don't.

09:57.854 --> 10:01.357
SILENCE

10:02.275 --> 10:03.318
Okay, think…

10:03.401 --> 10:06.571
- Snacks, weather, Yota, studying, Miki,
- SCHOOL EVENTS, SNACKS, WEATHER, YOTA

10:06.654 --> 10:07.488
- TV…
- CURRENT EVENTS, MIKI, STUDYING, CLASS 2

10:07.572 --> 10:09.407
STUDENTS, TV JR. HIGH SCHOOL

10:09.490 --> 10:10.742
I've been meaning to ask.

10:11.534 --> 10:13.620
Igarashi… You know him?

10:15.288 --> 10:17.123
Hm? Wait.

10:17.624 --> 10:19.959
Wh- What did he just ask me?

10:22.045 --> 10:22.879
Igarashi?

10:24.422 --> 10:26.090
Oh, why? Do you know him?

10:26.591 --> 10:30.345
Well, our soccer team has joint practices
with West High School sometimes.

10:30.845 --> 10:32.055
That's where I met him.

10:33.181 --> 10:35.058
Just wondering if you two were friends.

10:35.141 --> 10:37.143
Would he know you if I brought you up?

10:37.226 --> 10:39.103
No. We had no connection at all.

10:39.187 --> 10:40.271
I- I didn't know him.

10:41.189 --> 10:42.857
I doubt he'd recognize my name.

10:43.941 --> 10:44.776
Ah, gotcha.

10:44.859 --> 10:48.696
Well, he's visiting our school soon,
but you don't know each other, so never

10:48.780 --> 10:50.031
- mind.
- When?

10:50.114 --> 10:52.241
For a scrimmage, on the last day of
exams.

10:52.992 --> 10:53.826
Oh, okay.

10:54.535 --> 10:55.995
Definitely going home early.

10:59.624 --> 11:00.458
I wonder…

11:01.209 --> 11:04.629
Does the fact he's asking about him mean
that Amamiya is buddy-buddy

11:04.712 --> 11:06.422
with Igarashi?

11:06.923 --> 11:09.425
Yeah, our soccer team and his
school's team are planning to have a

11:09.509 --> 11:11.427
joint practice on the last day of exams.

11:11.511 --> 11:14.514
At the very least they're close enough to
know which schools the other went to.

11:14.597 --> 11:15.431
I'm pretty excited. I think it'll be fun,

11:15.515 --> 11:16.349
I can't focus on anything he's saying.

11:16.432 --> 11:18.851
And we'll totally kick their butts…

11:33.408 --> 11:34.367
Oh, and by the way!

11:34.909 --> 11:37.078
I brought last year's final exam
questions.

11:37.662 --> 11:40.790
I heard each year the questions
tend to be pretty much the same.

11:40.873 --> 11:42.917
Huh? How'd you get something like that?

11:43.000 --> 11:45.461
Well, I may've asked a senior for
a little favor.

11:47.171 --> 11:49.674
You coming to our classroom after school
today?

11:49.757 --> 11:50.883
Uh.

11:50.967 --> 11:51.801
Mm-hm.

11:52.927 --> 11:54.095
Awesome, see you then.

11:54.846 --> 11:55.888
BOW

12:00.768 --> 12:02.687
Morning. How's it goin'?

12:04.397 --> 12:06.023
What's the best way to put this?

12:07.525 --> 12:08.985
He can talk to anybody. He's like

12:09.068 --> 12:11.779
- some kinda, I dunno… communication
- SEEMS LIKE A COMMUNICATION EXPERT…

12:11.863 --> 12:13.197
- expert.
- Oh boy…

12:16.200 --> 12:18.244
I wonder how Miki feels about Amamiya?

12:19.370 --> 12:22.290
I mean, I don't really have proof of
anything just yet.

12:23.624 --> 12:26.878
But Miki was clearly very concerned
about how me and Amamiya knew

12:26.961 --> 12:27.795
each other.

12:30.047 --> 12:32.175
And him knowing Igarashi worries me.

12:33.217 --> 12:36.304
I think it might be best if I just keep
my distance from him.

12:42.894 --> 12:45.313
All I want is some peace and quiet.

12:51.736 --> 12:53.404
Koyun and Minato.

12:58.326 --> 13:00.411
- This is Yota.
- He's giant!

13:01.871 --> 13:04.081
And my little brother is like, super
strong.

13:04.791 --> 13:07.001
Mm-hm.
Yeah, we stopped by on the way home.

13:07.084 --> 13:08.085
The usual store.

13:09.086 --> 13:10.630
What're you worried about?

13:10.713 --> 13:12.548
I wonder what sides I got for lunch.

13:12.632 --> 13:13.758
Yeah, I can't wait.

13:13.841 --> 13:15.802
Oh. Er, Miki, do you wanna trade sides?

13:16.302 --> 13:17.804
Yeah, sure! I'm game!

13:19.013 --> 13:20.431
TUES 2ND, GRADE MEETING THURS 4TH,

13:20.515 --> 13:23.226
- THIRD PTA MEETING MON 8TH, GYM CLEANING
- Look, Hikawa.

13:23.309 --> 13:26.145
I appreciate your diligence and all, but
why don't you go out and enjoy your

13:26.229 --> 13:27.063
lunch break?

13:27.605 --> 13:29.440
The teacher's lounge is warmer.

13:29.524 --> 13:31.150
Are you a cat or something?

13:31.943 --> 13:33.486
Anyway, where were we?

13:33.986 --> 13:34.821
Oh right.

13:34.904 --> 13:37.532
You do it like this, then like this, and
there you go.

13:37.615 --> 13:39.158
Oh, I see now.

13:39.909 --> 13:42.328
Well good, I'm glad you understand,
now go have fun.

13:42.411 --> 13:45.081
- Shoo!
- Hmph. I'm going to Noriko's office.

13:45.623 --> 13:47.291
Don't just chase heaters all day.

13:49.377 --> 13:51.003
She certainly comes here often.

13:51.087 --> 13:52.713
Yeah, she really does.

13:53.464 --> 13:56.634
You know, I don't think I've
ever seen her hanging out with any

13:56.717 --> 13:58.344
other students. That worries me.

14:00.972 --> 14:04.058
Maybe she just feels more comfortable
being around grown ups.

14:04.642 --> 14:08.354
Cause you see, well, teachers have
to keep a certain professional distance

14:08.437 --> 14:10.314
between them and their students.

14:10.398 --> 14:13.818
There's a sense of security in
knowing that teachers are, in a sense,

14:13.901 --> 14:16.112
strangers who don't pry or get too
personal.

14:16.779 --> 14:17.613
Whatever!

14:21.117 --> 14:22.034
- But Ms. Suwa…
- Lounge.

14:22.118 --> 14:25.204
Sometimes you have to let people
live their own live and not shove your

14:25.288 --> 14:26.831
values down their throats.

14:26.914 --> 14:30.001
Matsumoto, what on earth happened to
you, huh?

14:31.377 --> 14:32.336
Let's see.

14:33.004 --> 14:36.257
Okay, I need my paint set and my
sketchbook.

14:37.341 --> 14:39.093
Do I need anything else for class?

14:39.176 --> 14:40.386
Or is that it?

14:42.179 --> 14:43.014
Hm?

14:43.598 --> 14:44.765
PEEK

14:44.849 --> 14:47.059
- Wait, are you being serious or are you
- Oh, it's Amamiya.

14:47.143 --> 14:47.977
Messing with me?

14:48.060 --> 14:49.478
- A MEMORY COMING BACK
- Why'd you ignore me?

14:49.562 --> 14:50.646
Flashback. My bubble.

14:52.607 --> 14:53.441
Well…

14:53.524 --> 14:55.902
He's surrounded by a bunch of
guys I don't know.

14:55.985 --> 14:58.362
Good. He hasn't even noticed I'm here.

14:58.446 --> 15:00.281
Be stealthy, like a panther.

15:00.907 --> 15:03.784
Mm. Technically, this isn't ignoring him.

15:05.077 --> 15:08.998
I- I just need to avoid being spotted and
make my escape.

15:10.124 --> 15:12.877
Oh, no, no, no, he's looking right at me!

15:12.960 --> 15:16.172
- Now give 'em the old quick bow and slip
- THE "QUICK BOW AND SLIP AWAY" TACTIC

15:16.255 --> 15:17.089
away tactic.

15:17.173 --> 15:18.007
YAY!

15:18.090 --> 15:19.675
- Oh no, he's drawing more attention.
- Hm?

15:19.759 --> 15:20.676
- Hm?
- Hm?

15:20.760 --> 15:22.345
- What is it? What's up?
- Stare.

15:23.054 --> 15:24.722
- Stare.
- Stare.

15:24.805 --> 15:26.515
- Stare.
- GAZE, GAZE, GAZE, GAZE

15:26.599 --> 15:28.976
Stop, stop! Just ignore me. Pretend
I'm not here or something.

15:29.060 --> 15:30.061
- Hm?
- One sec, guys.

15:30.144 --> 15:30.978
Poof!

15:31.062 --> 15:31.896
Poof!

15:32.897 --> 15:35.566
- Poof!
- Huh? W-w-why would he do that?

15:35.650 --> 15:36.484
Poof!

15:36.567 --> 15:39.236
- He's coming this way.
- Why are you hiding over here?

15:40.237 --> 15:42.490
Silly, you could've just said hi,
know you.

15:42.573 --> 15:44.033
Instead of just lurking.

15:44.700 --> 15:45.785
Oh. Yeah, I…

15:45.868 --> 15:47.453
Well, while I'm here…

15:48.496 --> 15:51.207
- Let me get your phone number.
- Distance…

15:58.881 --> 16:01.092
- Awesome, thank you.
- Mmm.

16:02.927 --> 16:04.053
What's in the bag?

16:05.262 --> 16:07.348
I have art class next, so it's uh…

16:08.224 --> 16:10.059
- Stuff for that.
- Oh, right.

16:10.768 --> 16:12.561
Class 2 has art as an elective.

16:12.645 --> 16:13.896
So, what do you do?

16:13.980 --> 16:14.981
You oil painting?

16:16.315 --> 16:19.235
No, we're… working with acrylic
right now.

16:19.819 --> 16:20.778
We're gonna crush it!

16:20.861 --> 16:21.904
Sure.

16:25.157 --> 16:25.992
Miki.

16:28.911 --> 16:30.246
- Oops.
- What's up?

16:30.329 --> 16:31.247
Huh? Uh, sorry!

16:31.330 --> 16:32.873
I better get going.

16:32.957 --> 16:34.750
- Run away!
- Oh…

16:37.294 --> 16:39.005
She was all by herself again.

16:41.215 --> 16:44.385
- TOWARD YOTA SMILE, HEE-HEE-HEE, RELIEVED
- Yota.

16:45.219 --> 16:47.013
- TOWARD MINATO NEW
- Gotta stop by my locker.

16:47.096 --> 16:48.639
Yeah, I better get going.

16:49.682 --> 16:50.516
Man…

16:50.599 --> 16:54.562
She acts so differently towards
someone she likes than to everyone else.

16:54.645 --> 16:57.648
- "Everyone else" means…
- EVERYONE ELSE->

17:00.860 --> 17:01.694
Yo, dude.

17:01.777 --> 17:04.655
I can't believe you had the guts
to talk to the Ice Queen.

17:04.739 --> 17:07.366
- I swear, you must have nerves of steel.
- Yeah. Well…

17:07.450 --> 17:09.744
I was hoping to get a bit closer to
her, but…

17:09.827 --> 17:11.120
Guess I scared her off.

17:13.080 --> 17:14.206
Kinda sad, right?

17:14.290 --> 17:15.207
Please, Minato.

17:15.291 --> 17:17.084
What would you know about sadness?

17:17.168 --> 17:18.127
Ha, right?

17:18.210 --> 17:20.671
What? Come on, I'm not like a robot or
something.

17:28.721 --> 17:30.306
Questions from last years exam!

17:30.890 --> 17:31.766
Minato…

17:32.516 --> 17:33.350
You're the best!

17:33.934 --> 17:36.437
Once I memorize these, it'll be a piece
of cake.

17:36.520 --> 17:38.647
Don't let your guard down now, Miki.

17:38.731 --> 17:39.815
Stay sharp.

17:40.316 --> 17:43.569
I heard the average score on the
last math exam was really low…

17:44.070 --> 17:46.280
So maybe they'll make this next
one easier.

17:46.363 --> 17:47.948
Man, I sure hope so!

17:48.449 --> 17:51.702
What'd you score on that test where
everyone did terribly, Yota?

17:51.786 --> 17:52.787
Hmm.

17:52.870 --> 17:53.788
Oh, come on!

17:54.705 --> 17:55.539
I'm confused.

17:55.623 --> 17:58.250
Because you could've tested into
East High School.

17:58.334 --> 18:00.211
And they have a basketball team.

18:00.294 --> 18:01.462
So why'd you come here?

18:01.545 --> 18:02.421
Huh?

18:02.505 --> 18:04.423
Oh, it's just closer to my house.

18:04.507 --> 18:07.009
You were okay with settling cause it
was closer?

18:07.093 --> 18:08.094
That's not why.

18:08.177 --> 18:12.098
He chose a less challenging school so
he'd be top of his class and get into

18:12.181 --> 18:13.015
a better college.

18:13.099 --> 18:16.435
He won't admit it, cause he knows you
barely made it in here, Miki.

18:16.519 --> 18:17.353
Wait. Is that true?

18:17.436 --> 18:18.979
Whoa! Hey, come on, Minato.

18:19.063 --> 18:20.523
That's not what it is.

18:20.606 --> 18:22.483
We live in very different worlds.

18:22.566 --> 18:23.984
Oh, stop, Miki…

18:26.237 --> 18:27.071
Mm?

18:27.154 --> 18:29.657
Koyun, wow, you're awfully focused today.

18:29.740 --> 18:31.575
- Hm?
- Oh, he changed the subject!

18:32.076 --> 18:35.830
Well, I was trying to be zen and clear
my mind of distractions.

18:36.664 --> 18:39.083
Wait, you're saying you have
distractions?

18:39.166 --> 18:40.000
Yeah.

18:40.084 --> 18:41.544
- NG
- My mind is full of them.

18:45.214 --> 18:47.633
Hm. She does act differently.

18:48.551 --> 18:49.844
Tell me, Hikawa

18:51.137 --> 18:51.971
You single?

18:54.473 --> 18:55.307
Huh?

18:56.559 --> 18:57.393
Oh, well…

18:58.060 --> 18:58.894
Uh, yeah.

19:00.187 --> 19:01.438
Why is he asking me that?

19:02.565 --> 19:04.024
Oh. I see.

19:05.317 --> 19:06.193
What was that?

19:06.694 --> 19:08.863
I wonder why he's asking me that.

19:09.822 --> 19:11.365
Igarashi… You know him?

19:14.160 --> 19:17.872
Could it be that Igarashi maybe put
him up to this?

19:18.622 --> 19:20.708
No way. I- I'm reading too much into it.

19:21.250 --> 19:22.877
He wouldn't send a spy.

19:23.502 --> 19:24.920
It was a long time ago.

19:25.004 --> 19:26.505
Even he wouldn't go that far.

19:27.214 --> 19:28.090
Minato.

19:29.341 --> 19:31.427
I wouldn't advise going after Koyun.

19:36.140 --> 19:37.808
Wait, is that's why he asked?

19:38.851 --> 19:40.186
Sorry, Dad, I can't do that?

19:40.269 --> 19:41.645
You can't have her hand.

19:42.146 --> 19:43.731
Ahh, he was just joking.

19:45.858 --> 19:47.443
I guess I was overthinking it.

19:48.277 --> 19:50.779
I'm so neurotic and paranoid too.

19:51.447 --> 19:52.281
Embarrassing.

19:54.158 --> 19:54.992
Oh no! Miki!

19:56.660 --> 19:57.786
Uhh. Agh!

19:59.079 --> 20:00.372
I can't read her face.

20:00.456 --> 20:01.582
What do I do now?

20:02.124 --> 20:05.586
She's my childhood best friend,
yet I can't tell what she's thinking.

20:07.004 --> 20:10.174
So, anyway…
I'm gonna hunt down some sugar!

20:10.799 --> 20:12.468
- SUGAR
- Sugar?

20:12.551 --> 20:13.385
Huh?

20:13.469 --> 20:14.970
Heading to the vending machine.

20:15.054 --> 20:17.348
Koyun and Yota, I'll buy you
something too.

20:17.431 --> 20:20.017
- What about me?
- Buy your own stuff, Minato.

20:20.100 --> 20:21.101
Hey.

20:22.228 --> 20:24.313
Or… Just come along.

20:30.152 --> 20:31.946
Ugh. I guess I could.

20:37.034 --> 20:38.202
We'll be right back!

20:45.292 --> 20:46.126
Miki?

20:47.920 --> 20:52.007
Okay, Miki.
Care to explain what that was all about?

20:55.344 --> 20:56.971
RIGHT BEFORE THE ACTUAL EXAM! PASS THE
EXAM

20:57.054 --> 20:58.722
The manga you recommended was great,
Ishida!

20:58.806 --> 21:00.891
Alright then, see you later, Yoshino!

21:01.392 --> 21:02.309
Hey, Yamashita!

21:02.810 --> 21:05.396
That anime you were telling me about the
other day?

21:05.479 --> 21:08.607
- Well, I finally got around to watching it
- Is it just me, or is Minato basically

21:08.691 --> 21:11.151
- and, man! I basically binge-watched
- always talking to someone?

21:11.235 --> 21:13.237
- The entire thing. It was so good. What
- Really? Huh.

21:13.320 --> 21:14.405
He's like that at school too.

21:14.488 --> 21:16.198
- Should I check out next?
- That's nice.

21:16.282 --> 21:17.908
I wish I could be like that.

21:17.992 --> 21:19.326
Minato collects strays.

21:19.827 --> 21:23.706
It's like, if he sees a loner, he refuses
to let them stay that way for long.

21:24.498 --> 21:27.334
- Huh?
- Yeah, it's cause he feels sorry for them.

21:29.503 --> 21:31.297
He feels sorry for them?

21:37.928 --> 21:38.762
Wait.

21:39.596 --> 21:42.016
This one's on me.
I need to buy one for Hikawa.

21:46.478 --> 21:47.313
But why?

21:47.980 --> 21:51.900
The other day, I snuck up on her and she
jumped…

21:51.984 --> 21:55.446
Which made her hit the button and
buy a weird flavor.

21:56.113 --> 21:59.450
Oh, it was this one.
Funny, I only just remembered that.

22:06.290 --> 22:07.416
Hey, Minato…

22:12.171 --> 22:14.465
Be honest, do you like Koyun?

22:22.139 --> 22:22.973
Huh?
